      },
      "message": "feat(mcp): tool component library, compatibility and assembly tools\n\nEight MCP tools over the #3644 component commands and the #3645 user\ncomponent library:\n- list_tool_components (kind, scope, compatible_with filters)\n- get_tool_assembly (stack, mounts, frames, cutting, gauge length,\n  sync status)\n- upsert_tool_component, delete_tool_component, set_tool_assembly,\n  sync_tool_component (the undoable GUI commands, one History step each)\n- save_library_component, delete_library_component (file edits; a\n  builtin: id is refused by name)\n\nA component crosses the door in the .camproj wire form; a stack as\nLinkDto. The library write tools are FileWrite in the live gate, and a\nstated library file on the reading tools is FilePathAccess. The\ncamcraft-mcp skill lists the new tools.\n\nFixes #3647\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
